OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Jazz Among The British
OL,6,     F4/5. Geoffrey Smith continues his
OL,7,     Fseries on changing perceptions of
OL,8,     Fjazz in Britain, with a closer
OL,9,     Flook at celebrated British pianist
OL,10,     Fand composer Stan Tracey.
OL,11,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,12,     FHannah Peel presents an
OL,13,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Feverything in between.
OL,17,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,18,     FMoses Boyd, in for Soweto Kinch,
OL,19,     Fpresents another hour of the best
OL,20,     Fin jazz, and Amy Gadiaga returns
OL,21,     Fwith her fourth 4/4 selection of
OL,22,     Fthe week.
